# Local project rules / progress — never publish to GitHub
rules_and_progress.md

# Editor/agent config — personal skills, rules, and IDE state stay local
.cursor/

# Personal/local test harness — not published
tests/
*_test.go

# Published manager regression tests used by GitHub Actions.
!.github/tests/
